# A page with one reading of the tree on it

## The matrix is green

Nothing decides this yet, and what installs a sibling plugin is read rather than
trusted:

```
git grep -nEi 'interoperab|jellyfin-plugin-(sso|requests|stats)' -- tree/
tree/a.yml.fixture:5:      - run: ./scan interoperability/claims
tree/b.yml.fixture:5:      - run: install jellyfin-plugin-sso
tree/c.yml.fixture:9:      - run: install jellyfin-plugin-stats
```

That is the whole of the reading.
